  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: NatbackInWhiterunHelpingTheHomeless
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703869959
    - rid: 4972360430703869960
    - rid: 4972360430703869961
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The four Companions are now on their way back to Jorrvaskr from Riften.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703869970
    - rid: 4972360430703869972
    - rid: 4972360430703869965
    - rid: 4972360475574796558
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703869973
    - rid: 4972360430703869974
    - rid: 4972360430703870090
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: They successfully brought the Valmir matter to the attention of Jarl
      Laila Law-Giver...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870033
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: But, after a brief debate in the court-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870034
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: It was determined that there was no current recourse to punish the Thalmor;
      not during the civil war.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870035
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Though, the Stormcloak-friendly regime of Riften was quick to express
      desires for... radical retribution.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870036
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870037
    - rid: 4972360430703870038
    - rid: 4972360430703870039
    - rid: 4972360430703870091
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ({mc} picked a <i>real</i> good time to go wandering...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360459354374144
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360459354374145
    - rid: 4972360459354374146
    - rid: 4972360459354374147
    - rid: 4972360475574796555
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah. Here's the rain I smelled earlier.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360459354374148
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796583
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So where's this homeless girl at?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796584
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: What-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796585
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, do you mean Lucia?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: You were serious about getting her a spot in Jorrvaskr?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course I was!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796586
    - rid: 4972360475574796594
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: There's some poor girl out there living on the streets, and I can easily
      do something about it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796587
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: It'd be wrong of me not to do what I can.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796588
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: You're being a bit naive, Jorrvaskr's no place for a child-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796589
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't care if I'm being naive!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796590
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: For the first time in my life-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796591
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: For the first time in my life...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796592
    - rid: 4972360475574796595
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: For the first time in my life, what <i>I</i> say goes...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796593
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796596
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever. Where is she?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796597
    - rid: 4972360475574796598
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: If I remember right, she usually hangs around doing chores in the Bannered
      Mare.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796600
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Then that's where we're going.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796601
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Might as well get drinks while we're there, eh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796602
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796603
    - rid: 4972360475574796604
    - rid: 4972360475574796605
    - rid: 4972360475574796606
    - rid: 4972360475574796607
    - rid: 4972360475574796611
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: True to his word, Farkas takes a seat at the bar, with the other two
      joining him.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796608
    - rid: 4972360475574796609
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Hulda, a bottle of Black-Briar for me-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas, you really drink that mammoth-spit?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796632
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, I don't tell you what you can and can't drink...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: While they engage in chicanery galore, Natsuki looks around for a small
      child.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796610
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Which doesn't take that long-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796633
    - rid: 4972360475574796634
    - rid: 4972360475574796635
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: A dirty-looking girl in a green dress, just in the room to the left of
      the entrance of the inn.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796636
    - rid: 4972360475574796642
